  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP -  LEAD (Leadership, Equality, Advocacy and Democracy)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LEAD project will implement a 3-fold approach to enhance human rights protection of vulnerable communities in Georgia: (i) empower rights holders by strengthening human rights of minorities, especially LGBTQI-people; (ii) counter prevalent homophobia, transphobia and xenophobia through social campaigns; (iii) support state institutions to move faster towards institutional democracy by strengthening citizen-centric and rights-based governance systems.</narrative>
  </description>
